  onboarding; fees and refund handling are unverified.
- Refunds on these methods are NOT wired into the admin refund controls; a top-up is refundable at our
  discretion per the Terms, and any refund to a local method should be checked against Stripe's per-method
  refund rules before the first one is promised.

### prd-022 SEA price test (`lib/sea-price-test.ts`)
50/50 on a stable visitor id (cookie `nx_vid`, else account id), signed-in visitors only, countries SG MY TH VN
ID PH KH LA MM BN TL IN BD PK LK NP, games Minecraft and Valheim, region sgp1. The lower price is a real coupon
created in the coupon engine (`sea_price_test_coupon`) and pre-filled into the promo field for the test arm,
so it is visible on the order and charged by the audited coupon path; the control arm sees list price.
Exposure is one `DeployFunnelEvent` (type select, step `sea_price_test`). `npx tsx
scripts/sea-price-test-report.ts [days]` (read-only) prints exposed, buyers and revenue per arm. It does not
measure anonymous visitors, bot share, margin, or VPN/arbitrage, and it computes no significance. Risks the
owner accepted by approving it: arbitrage (anyone who learns the code can type it) and margin.

